  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The United Nations Food and Agriculture Organization (FAO) seeks to raise levels of nutrition, improve agricultural productivity, better the lives of rural populations and contribute to the growth of the world economy. Funding under this initiative by the Australian Department of Agriculture, Fisheries and Forestry represents Australia&apos;s annual contribution to the FAO.</narrative>
